@startuml
title F08 - Missing morning activity workflow
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam ArrowColor #2877B5
skinparam ParticipantBorderColor #17324D
skinparam ParticipantBackgroundColor #F4F7FA
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FFF1BF
skinparam NoteBorderColor #9C6500
autonumber
control "Hub routine deadline timer" as HubTimer
control "H03\nHub time" as H03
control "H04\nHub coverage" as H04
control "H05\nHub rules adapter" as H05
control "S02\nDeterministic rules core" as S02
control "H02\nHub persistence" as H02
control "H08\nHub cloud link" as H08
control "B04\nIncident workflow" as B04
control "B05\nNotification routing" as B05
participant "Web Push provider" as Push
boundary "A04\nApp incidents" as A04
actor "Primary caregiver" as Caregiver
HubTimer -> H03: Grace deadline reached using monotonic time
H03 -> H05: Provide trusted earliest/latest wall-time estimate
H05 -> H04: Request required-source coverage state
H04 --> H05: Covered / Unknown / Fault plus reasons
H05 -> S02: Evaluate deadline with mode, evidence, time and coverage
note over H04,S02: Untrusted time, privacy/away/pause, test data or unknown coverage suppresses incident.
S02 --> H05: Return stable incident decision or suppression reason
H05 -> H02: Commit missing-activity incident intent once
H02 -> H08: Queue urgent cloud record
H08 -> B04: Idempotently create incident
B04 -> B05: Schedule bounded caregiver routes
B05 -> Push: Submit notification
Push -> Caregiver: Deliver missing-activity alert
Caregiver -> A04: Claim, acknowledge and later resolve
note over HubTimer,Caregiver: Outcome - A missing-activity alert is created only when observation coverage and time are trustworthy; otherwise the reason is explicit.
@enduml
